  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1529b99d-941f-4586-adbd-f39d9b6874ae"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "tests whether the pairing that the orientation of the Sullivan model ",
 StyleBox["model", "TI"],
 " induces on cohomology is perfect, checking the degrees ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["0", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6967e16c-166b-4859-920b-72f58e9ef23a"],
 " to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "+", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1dc451b6-90a3-48e5-b7fb-05d0733b01b7"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"f84dd85b-bbc7-4bc3-bb5c-3df1c0daca77"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["PoincareDualityQ"]], 
     "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/PoincareDualityQ", "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
    
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   StyleBox["complex", "TI"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "80c81210-fa57-4241-b218-0b0aeed359b4"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "tests whether the pairing of the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["CochainComplexWithPairing"]], 
    "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/CochainComplexWithPairing", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "d204d805-0e9f-431b-b8b0-976d8d9294b9"],
 " ",
 StyleBox["complex", "TI"],
 " is perfect on cohomology."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"553715d5-0621-40bc-b068-e96cd53fd2fe"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The pairing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["v", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["w", "TI"]}], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"v", "w"}], "TI"], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1ae1773d-9767-4b3a-97a1-8d2c132f3aa9"],
 " vanishes when one of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["v", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f6dd11f4-7af3-4699-b001-461930d8cfc3"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["w", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3fd7020b-e1b0-4b20-ac32-6709af4c51b4"],
 " is a boundary and the other a cocycle, so it descends to cohomology."
}], "Notes",
 CellFrameLabels->{{Inherited, Inherited}, {Inherited, 
    Cell[
     TextData[{
      "26.09.30: Design review - the predicate answers the hypothesis under \
which HodgeTypeQ decides Hodge type, and HodgeTypeQ is guarded by it (H2, \
2026-09-24). On a model it computes the cohomology degree by degree, and an \
untruncated model with a generator of even degree is infinite-dimensional, so \
the test stops at a degree: n+1 by default, with the option \"MaxDegree\" as \
in HodgeTypeQ. Since R7 (Pavel, 2026-10-01) a value below n returns \
unevaluated, since duality needs every degree from 0 to n; before, it was \
read as n and changed nothing. Beyond that degree it cannot see, which the \
page shows on the model with generators of degrees 2, 3 and 6 (H1, \
2026-09-24). On a complex, which is finite-dimensional, it checks every \
degree, is exact and takes no option. Prior art: the Wolfram Language has no \
cohomology of cochain complexes; the cocycles, the boundaries and the rank of \
the pairing on them are NullSpace and MatrixRank computations. The engine the \
verification suites load has no Poincar\[EAcute] duality test; the suites pin \
this predicate over the catalogue, all of whose models are oriented PDGAs, \
and on T^2 oriented in degree 1, which is not.", "\n\n", 
       Cell[
        BoxData[
         GridBox[{{
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Edit"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationButton"]]], 
            StyleBox[
             RowBox[{
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "LastAnnotator"]], "pavel"}], 
             "TextAnnotator"], 
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Delete"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationRemoveButton"]]], ""}}, 
          GridBoxAlignment -> {
           "Columns" -> {Left, Left, Right, Right}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, 
          GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.68], 
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.02]}}]]], "\n"}], "TextAnnotation", 
     CellSize -> {590, Inherited}]}},
 CellTags->"TextAnnotation",
 CellID->323926539,ExpressionUUID->"3779cfde-be01-40ef-a546-14767255a282"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A model of degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a34b1b9d-2378-470d-aa05-1e6ea4a3e67e"],
 " is an oriented PDGA when the pairing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[Cross]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", 
      StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]], "\[Rule]", 
    StyleBox["K",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "53de1b05-3ba1-4a38-934b-c74d84c09335"],
 " is nondegenerate for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"0", "\[LessEqual]", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], "\[LessEqual]", 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c4a4658e-cc4b-4e88-8fdd-aa5345e0defe"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "26682723-26a0-412a-acb0-964217e92ecd"],
 " for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], ">", 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5cd72f98-6779-4527-b7bf-8c1df0c897bd"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"2ebf3c73-06d6-44b3-8a24-a949f6740e7c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For a model the test runs in the degrees ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["0", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9556a95a-9f18-4260-941a-59e1105ed7ee"],
 " to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "+", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "96accce7-87af-4d24-8113-e87720fd17a7"],
 " by default and does not look further up."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"d370ab92-bc2f-414d-958e-92341e489179"],

Cell["\<\
For a complex every degree is checked, and the test is exact. The complex \
form takes no option.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"261c60b0-6419-4a8e-a2f5-9e17cce2b5af"],

