 " is not: its cohomology in degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["1", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "98cfacd0-98dc-4ca6-8f78-5b0e1e197272"],
